  unitName: "Ken Kaneki (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 850767
  unitNumber: 8537
  description: A young man who was engrossed with reading books, Kaneki was quite
    gentle towards the people around him - sometimes excessively so. It was this
    vulnerability and gentle nature that allowed a well-known ghoul the opportunity
    to eat him while they were alone. It was only by sheer chance that he was saved
    by falling steel beams, only to wake up later in the hospital with his attacker's
    organs implanted in him - ostensibly to save his life. It was from that point
    that he slowly began to experience a gnawing hunger for human flesh...
  summonDesc: I'm not the protagonist of a book or anything... I'm just a college
    student who likes to read!...
  fusionDesc: Children. Girl. Woman. Boy. Man. Flesh. Flesh. Flesh. FLESH!
  evoDesc: '-'
